//! The `grid-auto-flow` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property controls
//! how the auto-placement algorithm works, specifying exactly how auto-placed items get flowed into
//! the grid.
//!
//! Initial: row. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: [ row | column ] || dense
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid-2/#propdef-grid-auto-flow
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/grid-auto-flow
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

module std.css.properties.GridAutoFlow.

